  "body": "`<img align=bottom>` works as [spec'ed](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attributes-for-embedded-content-and-images) on Firefox Win/Mac, but not on Blink/WebKit and Firefox Linux.\r\n\r\n[test@jsbin](https://jsbin.com/luwozelive/edit?html,output)\r\n\r\nFrom Blink's code, \"bottom\" is \"baseline\" and \"absbottom\" is \"bottom\":\r\nhttps://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_element.cc?type=cs&q=applyAlignmentAttributeToStyle&sq=package:chromium&g=0&l=798\r\n\r\nSame in WebKit:\r\nhttps://trac.webkit.org/browser/webkit/trunk/Source/WebCore/html/HTMLElement.cpp#L603\r\n\r\nFrom our git history, this is at least since 2006:\r\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/33030df92939cbc4e3097d21ba3995b64d723093%5E%21/third_party/WebKit/WebCore/khtml/html/HTMLElement.cpp\r\n\r\nOriginally from [crbug.com/987674](https://crbug.com/987674).",
